0 + 12 + 100 = 678; then main nav 66 + 34 home indicator = 778. Fits in 812. I'll fine-tune.\n\n4. **04_Home_Upcoming_Bills** — same header, same segmented control (Upcoming Bills active), bill actions row (Add, Edit, Delete icon buttons), 3 bill cards (Line $21.00 Sep 05 2023, Adobe XD $126.02 Sep 19 2023, Netflix $932.53 Jul 08 2024) each with logo, name, amount, due date, cycle \"1 month\"/\"1 year\", category \"Subscriptions\", Pay now button. Main nav Home active.\n\n5. **05_Home_Transactions** — same header, segmented (Transactions active), 6 transaction rows with logo, name, type, date, signed amount. Main nav Home active.\n\n6. **06_Discussion_Forum** — back + title \"Discussion Forum\" + message + bell. Search bar + Filter button. Topic chips (Personal Finance selected, Investments, Cryptocurrencies). 2 post cards: Devon Lane (verified, liked state — like icon in primary color), Eleanor Pena (verified). Each: avatar, name, topic, date/time, body, counts 12 Comments · 160 Likes · 0 Dislikes, more menu. No main nav. Back → 03.\n\n7. **07_Cards** — back + \"Cards\" title + avatar + more menu. Primary card art (Card_Art_Green with Esaaa Warden, **** 3447, Exp 09/24) + Add Card button/card. \"Assets\" list: Solana SOL $12,094.08, Bitcoin BTC $17,238.11, Ethereum ETH $8,200.00 with crypto icons. Transactions latest 3 (PayPal -123, DANA -12, Google Play +234). Main nav Cards active. Links: back → 03, Bitcoin → 10, tabs.\n\n8. **08_Profile** — back + \"Profile\" + more menu... Actually must include: account Esaaa Warden, avatar, primary card number, edit profile entry; actions back, messages entry, notifications entry, more menu. \"Your Cards\" all 3 cards. Transactions latest 3 + See all. Main nav Profile active. Links: See all → 05, tabs.\n\n9. **09_Analytics** — back + \"Analytics\" + avatar + more menu. View switch Income/Expenses (Income selected). Period \"Monthly\" dropdown. Total income $29,231.03 / Total expenses $1,999.00 cards. Income breakdown: donut chart with headline 52%, legend Sales $15,190.00 52% / Investment $11,451.03 39% / Other $2,590.00 9%. Main nav Analytics active. Back → 03, tabs.\n\n10. **10_Markets** — back + \"Markets\" + avatar. Bitcoin header with logo, price, change. \"Current price\" $1,954.00 (+3.85%) in green. Candlestick chart (y $1,000–$5,000; x 08:00–24:00 with labels 08:00 10:00 12:00 15:00 18:00 21:00 24:00). Range chips 1H 2H 8H 1D 1W 1M 1Y (1D selected). History + See all: Solana, Bitcoin, Ethereum rows. Sell / Buy buttons at bottom. No main nav. Back → 07.\n\n11. **11_Send** — back + \"Send\" + avatar. Recipient row: Bessie Cooper avatar, name, card **** **** **** 8820, change option. Amount display $500.00. Number pad 1-9, ., 0, backspace. Send button. No main nav. Back → 03, Send → 03.\n\n**Prototype connections:**\n- 01 Continue → 02\n- 02 back → 01; Continue → 03\n- 03: Upcoming Bills → 04; Transactions → 05; Send → 11; contact Bessie Cooper → 11; Financial health details → 09; messages entry → 06; tabs Home → 03, Analytics → 09, Cards → 07, Profile → 08\n- 04: My Balance → 03; Transactions → 05; tabs\n- 05: My Balance → 03; Upcoming Bills → 04; tabs\n- 06: back → 03\n- 07: back → 03; Bitcoin row → 10; tabs\n- 08: See all → 05; tabs\n- 09: back → 03; tabs\n- 10: back → 07\n- 11: back → 03; Send → 03\n\n**Approach for building:**\n\nSince components in the reference pages cannot be directly \"used\" across pages via instance creation... actually they can! `figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2:36')` gives the component; I can call `comp.createInstance()` and append to my workspace frames. Components can live on other pages; instances in my workspace page will still reference them. That's the cleanest way to reuse logos/icons/cards/flags/avatar and the platform shell, plus Button/Text Field components.\n\nHowever — the Button component is 335 wide (fixed?). It's a component with layoutMode HORIZONTAL, so createInstance then resize. The Text Field component similarly has auto-layout.\n\nFor the