-driven rows via function produce frames, not instances. Trade-off is fine — visual consistency is what matters. But I'll make components for: Tab Bar (4 states), Segmented View Switch (3 states), OTP digit box, Chip, Icon Action Button, Header Bar variants, Keypad key, Transaction row (as component with overrides where feasible), Bill card, Crypto row, Post card.\n\nActually, let me be pragmatic. The heavy lifting is 11 screens × ~30 nodes = ~350+ nodes. I'll write helper functions in use_figma code and build 1-2 screens per call. Components where quick:\n\nCore components to create in Workspace (as COMPONENT nodes):\n- C_Avatar (uses Avatar_Neutral instance inside, sizes)\n- C_IconBtn (circle bg + icon instance, icon swap via param)\n- C_Chip (topic pill: selected + default via two components or text+fill override)\n- C_Segmented (3 states)\n- C_TabBar (4 states)\n- C_TransactionRow (logo icon instance, texts override-able)\n- C_BillCard\n- C_CryptoRow\n- C_KeypadKey\n- C_PostCard? (2 posts, one liked) — I'll build inline function.\n\nWait — important note: component instances of reference components (logos etc.) inside my own components is fine.\n\nOne issue: `createInstance` from components on other pages — allowed. \n\nAlso `figma.combineAsVariants` — fine.\n\nFonts: must load \"Plus Jakarta Sans\" Regular/Medium/SemiBold before setting text. figma.loadFontAsync for each. The status bar uses Inter Semi Bold — instances don't need font loading unless I change text.\n\nLet me also check what 04 Media Card_Art looks like — the card art has artwork only. For the primary card in 07 and cards in 08, I instance Card_Art_Green etc. and overlay text (holder name, number, expiry). Need to see what the artwork contains (maybe has chip/logo). Let me screenshot the media page later; first, let me look at Card_Art_Green structure quickly.\n\nAlso for the \"Pay now\" button on bills and other small buttons, I'll design secondary buttons (light lavender fill #EFEcFB, radius 26