n; leave unlinked); Add → none.\n\nLinks wired later. Bessie Cooper contact chip (first contact at x=6) → 11_Send. Financial health card → 09. Message icon → 06. Tabs → 03/09/07/08.\n\nComponent instances needed: Tab Bar·Active=Home, View Switch·Active=My Balance, Action·Send/Receive/Add, Header icons (Message/Bell), Contact·Person ×5 with name overrides, Avatar for header (Avatar_Neutral direct instance 48).\n\nContact name override: instance.findOne(n=>n.name==='Name').characters='Bessie Cooper' etc.\n\nTransfer list \"add contact\" element: I'll use Contact·Add instance in the row? Then 6 items don't fit. Alternative: header \"Add\" pill. Row = 5 contacts only. Good.\n\nBalance card gradient: fills=[{type:'GRADIENT_LINEAR', gradientTransform:[[1,0,0],[0,1,0]]... For diagonal: gradientTransform [[0.7,0.7,0],[-0.7,0.7,0.15]]? Keep simple: [[1,0,0],[0,1,0]] left→right horizontal. stops: 0 #CDC6FE, 1 #B3A9FA. Plus subtle inner? OK.\n\nWrite Call C now. Also remember fills override on status bar instance: inst.fills=[] — allowed on instances.","signature":"e8edb1577b8a480f8c63c062"}],"id":"9f33578a-3c26-4589-ac8e-4184f813e779","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c056878-bafb-4cce-9f60-9b23b7b83728","uuid":"89a2948f-2a99-4788-8464-95728de88742","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:39:55.966Z","thinking_duration_ms":41149}
