{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\nComplete a Figma product design benchmark (unattended session). Requirements from the system-level brief and the user's Chinese message:\n- Assigned file ONLY: https://www.figma.com/design/LzOLhHIkMxbZRdyAhxIn1B/ (fileKey `LzOLhHIkMxbZRdyAhxIn1B`); account must be zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (confirmed via whoami)\n- Read 「00·Start Here」 for the design task, follow 「01·Foundations」 visual spec, reuse 「02·Components」, use 「04·Media」 assets, deliver the complete design into 「03·Workspace」\n- Preserve all reference pages and their nodes; do not create a different file or switch accounts\n- Build exactly 11 named frames (375×812, light mode), wire them as a clickable prototype with specified links, match all fixed copy/data verbatim, create reusable components for everything beyond the given defaults, then verify via screenshots of all screens\n- Every assistant message with a tool call must start with a line prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; final response must have `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:` with the assigned file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and any remaining limitations\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n- Figma Plugin API via `use_figma` tool: createFrame/createComponent/createText/createRectangle/createEllipse, component.createInstance(), instance.swapComponent(), node.reactions for prototype links, page.flowStartingPoints, setRangeFontName/setRangeFills for mixed-style text, tintIcon (recolor instance vectors by overriding strokes/fills recursively)\n- Font loading: `figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Plus Jakarta Sans', style:'Regular'|'Medium'|'SemiBold'})` before any text creation\n- lineHeight API: must be `{value: px, unit:'PIXELS'}` (NOT `{px: n}`)\n- Rate limits: Figma MCP enterprise limit hit once; retry after a short wait succeeds\n- Fixed brand: primary #BFB7FD, Plus Jakarta Sans, canvas 375×812, light mode only\n- Prototype reactions format: `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'}, action:{type:'NODE', destinationId, navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition:{type:'INSTANT'}}}]`\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n- **Figma pages** (all read-only references): 0:1 (00·Start Here), 1:2 (01·Foundations), 1:3 (02·Components), 1:4 (04·Media), 2003:2 (03·Workspace — delivery target, was empty)\n- **Reference component specs inspected**: Button (3:52) 335×52 fill #BFB7FD radius 26, text \"Continue\" Medium 15 #151521; Text Field (3:71): label Medium 14 ink, input white/1px #E4E2EE stroke/radius 12, value Medium 15 gray #A0A0A0; Status Bar (6:110) 375×44 white fill, \"9:41\" Inter Semi Bold 15; Home Indicator (6:122) 375×34 white fill, dark rect 134×5 radius 100\n- **Media component ID map** (used in all build calls):\n```js\nconst IM={btn:'3:52',Line:'2:26',Netflix:'2:25',AdobeXD:'2:24',PayPal:'2:27',DANA:'2:28',GooglePlay:'2:29',Shopee:'2:30',Apple:'2:31',Spotify:'2:32',Solana:'2:33',Bitcoin:'2:34',Ethereum:'2:35',CardGreen:'2:36',CardPink:'2:37',CardPurple:'2:38',FlagUSA:'2:63',FlagIndo:'2:62',Avatar:'2:65',Icon_Home:'2:2',Icon_Analytics:'2:3',Icon_Cards:'2:4',Icon_Profile:'2:5',Icon_Bell:'2:6',Icon_Message:'2:7',Icon_Back:'2:8',Icon_ArrowUpRight:'2:9',Icon_Plus:'2:10',Icon_Edit:'2:11',Icon_Delete:'2:12',Icon_Send:'2:13',Icon_Receive:'2:14',Icon_Search:'2:15',Icon_Filter:'2:16',Icon_ChevronDown:'2:17',Icon_MoreH:'2:18',Icon_MoreV:'2:19',Icon_Comment:'2:20',Icon_Like:'2:21',Icon_Dislike:'2:22',Icon_Verified:'2:23'};\n```\n- **Screen frames created** (row at y=0, x=i*415): 01_Sign_Up=2005:2, 02_OTP=2005:3, 03_Home_My_Balance=2005:4, 04_Home_Upcoming_Bills=2005:5, 05_Home_Transactions=2005:6, 06_Discussion_Forum=2005:7, 07_Cards=2005:8, 08_Profile=2005:9, 09_Analytics=2005:10, 10_Markets=2005:11, 11_Send=2005:12. Backgrounds: 01/02 white; 03–11 #F6F5FA.\n- **23 reusable components created** on workspace page (y≈960+, label \"Balance · Design System Components (reusable)\"): 4× \"Tab Bar · Active=Home/Analytics/Cards/Profile\" (375×64 white, top hairline, icon 24 y=10, label 11 y=38, active deep #7C68EE SemiBold / inactive muted Medium); 3× \"View Switch · Active=My Balance/Upcoming Bills/Transactions\" (335×40 bg #EFEDF8 radius 12, white pill 109×32 at x=4+i*109 y=4 radius 9); 3× \"Action · Send/Receive/Add\" (76×76, circle 48 primary, icon 22 ink, label 12); 4× \"Header Icon · Message/Bell/Back/More\" (40×40 white circle stroke border, icon 20 ink); 2× \"Topic Chip · Selected(primary)/Default(white+border)\" radius 16 h32; \"OTP Box\" (56×56 white radius 12 stroke 1.5); \"Keypad Key\" (111×44, child text named 'Digit', Medium 22); \"Contact · Add\" (dashed deep circle + plus) and \"Contact · Person\" (avatar 44 + name 9.5 centered, 64×62); \"Bill Card\" (335×76 white radius 16 shadow, LogoBg 44 @(16,16), nested 'Logo' 28 @(24,24), 'Name' 13.5 SemiBold @(74,14), 'Meta' 10.5 @(74,37), 'Category' 10 @(74,54), 'Amount' 15 @(247,14), PayNow 84×30 primary @(235,36) with 'Pay now' 11); \"Transaction Row\" (335×56 transparent, LogoBg 40 @(0,8), 'Logo' 24 @(8,16), 'Name' 14 @(52,7), 'Meta' 11 @(52,30), 'Amount' 14 @(250,19)); \"Crypto Row\" (335×52, 'Logo' 32 @(0,10), 'Name' 14 @(44,6), 'Ticker' 11 @(44,29), 'Value' 14 @(230,17))\n- **Design system defined**: ink #151521, sec #6B6880, muted #A5A3B0, border #E9E7F2, bg #F6F5FA, chip #EFEDF8, primary #BFB7FD, deep #7C68EE, deepSoft #EDEAFD, success #16A34A, error #F04438; shadows `{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.09,g:0.08,b:0.15,a},offset:{x:0,y},radius:b,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}`\n- **Shared helper code** (pasted per call):\n```js\nfunction T(p,chars,o){o=o||{};const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:F,style:o.st||'Medium'};t.fontSize=o.s||14;t.characters=chars;t.fills=[S(o.c||C.ink)];if(o.lh)t.lineHeight={value:o.lh,unit:'PIXELS'};if(o.w){t.textAutoResize='NONE';t.resize(o.w,o.h||20);}else{t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';}if(o.a)t.textAlignHorizontal=o.a;if(o.x!==undefined)t.x=o.x;if(o.y!==undefined)t.y=o.y;if(o.name)t.name=o.name;p.appendChild(t);return t;}\nfunction tintIcon(n,hex){const paint=S(hex);for(const ch of n.findAll(()=>true)){if('strokes'in ch&&ch.strokes&&ch.strokes.length>0)ch.strokes=[paint];if('fills'in ch&&ch.fills&&ch.fills.length>0&&ch.type!=='TEXT')ch.fills=[paint];}}\nfunction inst(key,p,x,y,w,h){const i=COMP[key].createInstance();i.resize(w,h||w);i.x=x;i.y=y;p.appendChild(i);return i;}\nfunction legal(f,y){/* 12px Regular sec, lineHeight 18, w327 center; ranges: 'Terms of Service'(+16), 'Privacy Policy'(+14) → Medium deep via setRangeFontName/setRangeFills */}\n```\n- **01_Sign_Up built** (9 children): Status Bar @(0,0), BrandMark 64×64 primary radius 20 @(155.5,104) with 'B' SemiBold 30, \"Sign up\" SemiBold 28 centered y=200, \"Sign up with phone number\" Medium 14 @(24,296), Phone Input 327×56 white radius 12 stroke border @(24,324) containing FlagIndo 16 @(16,20), '+62' Medium 15 @(40,18), chevron 14 muted tinted @(68,21), divider 1×24 @(92,16), '858 2409 3560' Medium 15 @(110,18), helper \"A code will be sent to your number\" Regular 12 @(24,392), Btn Continue (Button instance 327×52) @(24,452), Legal @(24,706), Home Indicator @(0,778)\n- **02_OTP built** (12 children): Status Bar, Back icon 40 tinted ink @(24,60), \"OTP\" SemiBold 22 centered y=63, \"Enter code\" Regular 14 muted centered y=112, 4 OTP boxes 56×56 @(51.5+i*72,196), \"Resend code\" Medium 14 deep centered y=296, Btn Continue @(24,452), Legal @(24,706), Home Indicator @(0,778)\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n- **lineHeight validation error**: `t.lineHeight={px:o.lh}` threw \"Property lineHeight failed validation: Invalid discriminator value. Expe