{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_37f6f55c54c6477b9af7a045","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"== Start Here\n  |LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n  |Balance — personal finance app\n  |Design the complete Balance mobile app: a personal finance app where Esaaa Warden signs up with a phone number, checks the balance, upcoming bills and transactions, manages cards and crypto assets, reads income analytics, follows a coin price, sends money to a contact and browses a community forum. ⏎ Canvas 375 × 812, light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  |How to work\n  |1. Build exactly the 11 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. ⏎ 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. ⏎ 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. ⏎ 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. ⏎ 5. Use logos, card artwork, flags and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral or initials. ⏎ 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\n  |Frames · goals · must include · links\n  |Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\n  |01_Sign_Up\n  |Goal: Start registration with a phone number.\n  |MUST INCLUDE\n  |• Actions: Continue ⏎ • Copy: “Sign up” · “Sign up with phone number” · “A code will be sent to your number” ⏎ • Legal: “By signing up, you agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, including Cookie Use.” (Terms of Service and Privacy Policy are links) ⏎ • Phone: country code +62 (Flag_Indonesia, changeable) · number 858 2409 3560\n  |LINKS\n  |→ Continue → 02_OTP\n  |02_OTP\n  |Goal: Verify the phone number with a 4-digit code.\n  |MUST INCLUDE\n  |• Actions: back · Resend code · Continue ⏎ • Code: 4 digits, none entered yet ⏎ • Copy: “OTP” · “Enter code” ⏎ • Legal: same text as 01_Sign_Up\n  |LINKS\n  |→ back → 01_Sign_Up ⏎ → Continue → 03_Home_My_Balance\n  |03_Home_My_Balance\n  |Goal: See the total balance at a glance and start money actions.\n  |MUST INCLUDE\n  |• Account: avatar · “Hi, Esaaa!” · messages entry · notifications entry ⏎ • Actions: Send · Receive · Add ⏎ • Balance: “Your Balance” $190,008.03 · +8% · currency USD (Flag_USA, changeable) ⏎ • Main navigation: current tab Home ⏎ • Spending: “Financial health” · “Latest 7 days” · daily spend Mon–Sun with values on a 10K–50K scale · entry to details ⏎ • Transfer list: “Transfer list” · add contact · 5 contacts ⏎ • View: switch between My Balance / Upcoming Bills / Transactions · current: My Balance\n  |LINKS\n  |→ Upcoming Bills → 04_Home_Upcoming_Bills ⏎ → Transactions → 05_Home_Transactions ⏎ → Send → 11_Send ⏎ → contact Bessie Cooper → 11_Send ⏎ → Financial health details → 09_Analytics ⏎ → messages entry → 06_Discussion_Forum ⏎ → tabs → 03 / 09 / 07 / 08\n  |04_Home_Upcoming_Bills\n  |Goal: Review upcoming subscription bills and pay one.\n  |MUST INCLUDE\n  |• Account: same as 03 ⏎ • Bill actions: Add · Edit · Delete ⏎ • Bills: “Upcoming Bills” · 3 bills, soonest due first, each with logo, name, amount, due date, cycle, category and Pay now ⏎ • Main navigation: current tab Home ⏎ • View: same switch as 03 · current: Upcoming Bills\n  |LINKS\n  |→ My Balance → 03 ⏎ → Transactions → 05 ⏎ → tabs\n  |05_Home_Transactions\n  |Goal: Scan recent money movement.\n  |MUST INCLUDE\n  |• Account: same as 03 ⏎ • Main navigation: current tab Home ⏎ • Transactions: “Transactions” · 6 transactions, newest first, each with logo, type, date and signed amount (+ money in, − money out) ⏎ • View: same switch as 03 · current: Transactions\n  |LINKS\n  |→ My Balance → 03 ⏎ → Upcoming Bills → 04 ⏎ → tabs\n  |06_Discussion_Forum\n  |Goal: Browse community finance discussions.\n  |MUST INCLUDE\n  |• Actions: back · messages entry · notifications entry ⏎ • Copy: “Discussion Forum” ⏎ • Posts: 2 posts, each with avatar, name, verified badge, topic, date and time, body, comment / like / dislike counts and a more menu · the user has liked Devon Lane’s post ⏎ • Search & filter: search “Search...” · Filter ⏎ • Topics: Personal Finance / Investments / Cryptocurrencies · current: Personal Finance\n  |LINKS\n  |→ back → 03_Home_My_Balance\n  |07_Cards\n  |Goal: See the primary card and crypto assets.\n  |MUST INCLUDE\n  |• Actions: back · avatar · more menu · Add Card ⏎ • Assets: “Assets” · Solana / Bitcoin / Ethereum with ticker and value ⏎ • Card: primary card (Card_Art_Green, Esaaa Warden, **** **** **** 3447, Exp 09/24) ⏎ • Copy: “Cards” ⏎ • Main navigation: current tab Cards ⏎ • Transactions: latest 3\n  |LINKS\n  |→ back → 03 ⏎ → Bitcoin → 10_Markets ⏎ → tabs\n  |08_Profile\n  |Goal: See account identity, all cards and recent activity.\n  |MUST INCLUDE\n  |• Account: Esaaa Warden · avatar · primary card number · edit profile entry ⏎ • Actions: back · messages entry · notifications entry · more menu ⏎ • Cards: “Your Cards” · all 3 cards ⏎ • Copy: “Profile” ⏎ • Main navigation: current tab Profile ⏎ • Transactions: “Transactions” · See all · latest 3\n  |LINKS\n  |→ See all → 05_Home_Transactions ⏎ → tabs\n  |09_Analytics\n  |Goal: Understand income vs expenses and where income comes from.\n  |MUST INCLUDE\n  |• Actions: back · avatar · more menu ⏎ • Copy: “Analytics” ⏎ • Income breakdown chart: Sales $15,190.00 · 52% / Investment $11,451.03 · 39% / Other $2,590.00 · 9% · headline share “52%” ⏎ • Main navigatio"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c056878-bafb-4cce-9f60-9b23b7b83728","uuid":"0de3f2f1-b54f-43a3-9288-0f460e68ddb6","timestamp":"2026-10-28T18:45:47.857Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"== Start Here\n  |LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n  |Balance — personal finance app\n  |Design the complete Balance mobile app: a personal finance app where Esaaa Warden signs up with a phone number, checks the balance, upcoming bills and transactions, manages cards and crypto assets, reads income analytics, follows a coin price, sends money to a contact and browses a community forum. ⏎ Canvas 375 × 812, light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  |How to work\n  |1. Build exactly the 11 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. ⏎ 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. ⏎ 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. ⏎ 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. ⏎ 5. Use logos, card artwork, flags and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral or initials. ⏎ 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed 