{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\nComplete a Figma product design benchmark (unattended session). Requirements:\n- Assigned file ONLY: https://www.figma.com/design/LzOLhHIkMxbZRdyAhxIn1B/ (fileKey `LzOLhHIkMxbZRdyAhxIn1B`); account must be zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (confirmed via whoami earlier)\n- Read 「00·Start Here」 for product/screens/states/data/copy/prototype requirements; follow 「01·Foundations」 visual spec; reuse 「02·Components」; use 「04·Media」 assets; deliver complete design into 「03·Workspace」 (page 2003:2, was empty)\n- Preserve all reference pages and their nodes; do not create a different file or switch accounts; keep existing unrelated content intact\n- Build exactly 11 named frames (375×812, light mode), wire as clickable prototype with specified links, match all fixed copy/data verbatim, create reusable components, verify via screenshots of ALL screens, fix visible problems, finish all screens/states/flows before final answer\n- Every assistant message with a tool call must start with a line prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; final response must have `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:` containing the assigned file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations\n- Prototype brief (from 00·Start Here): frame names fixed; main navigation tabs in order Home→03, Analytics→09, Cards→07, Profile→08 on frames 03/04/05/07/08/09 with current tab matching; pushed screens with back: 02, 06, 07, 08, 09, 10, 11; 06/10/11 have NO main nav; no Receive/notifications/payment-success screens (do not add frames beyond the 11)\n- Links: 01 Continue→02; 02 back→01, Continue→03; 03 Upcoming Bills→04, Transactions→05, Send→11, contact Bessie Cooper→11, Financial health details→09, messages→06, tabs→03/09/07/08; 04 My Balance→03, Transactions→05, tabs; 05 My Balance→03, Upcoming Bills→04, tabs; 06 back→03; 07 back→03, Bitcoin→10, tabs; 08 See all→05, tabs; 09 back→03, tabs; 10 back→07; 11 back→03, Send→03\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n- Figma Plugin API via `use_figma` tool: createFrame/createText/createRectangle/createEllipse, component.createInstance(), instance.swapComponent(), node.reactions for prototype links, page.flowStartingPoints, setRangeFontName/setRangeFills, tintIcon (recolor vectors), dashPattern, cornerRadius, arcData for donut segments, textAutoResize 'HEIGHT' for measuring wrapped text\n- **CRITICAL reactions schema fix**: `{type:'INSTANT'}` transition is REJECTED. Correct format: `node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},action:{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE'}}]` — omit transition entirely\n- Reactions CANNOT be set on nodes inside instances → transparent hit-frame overlays (opacity 0.001) on top of tab bar / view switch instances\n- Cannot appendChild into instances (card art must be wrapped in plain frame with overlay texts on the frame)\n- Cannot set x/y (relative-transform) on children of instances → fixed Keypad Key component by centering Digit text within the component itself (textAutoResize NONE, resize 111×44, CENTER/CENTER)\n- Font loading: `await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Regular'|'Medium'|'SemiBold'})` before text\n- lineHeight must be `{value:px,unit:'PIXELS'}`\n- Rate limit: \"You've reached the Figma MCP tool call limit for your Full seat on the Enterprise plan\" — retry after brief wait succeeds (happened 3× now)\n- Fixed brand: primary #BFB7FD, Plus Jakarta Sans, canvas 375×812, light mode only\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n- **Figma pages**: 0:1 (00·Start Here, read-only ref), 1:2 (01·Foundations), 1:3 (02·Components), 1:4 (04·Media), 2003:2 (03·Workspace — delivery target)\n- **Media component ID map** (used every call):\n```js\nconst IM={btn:'3:52',Line:'2:26',Netflix:'2:25',AdobeXD:'2:24',PayPal:'2:27',DANA:'2:28',GooglePlay:'2:29',Shopee:'2:30',Apple:'2:31',Spotify:'2:32',Solana:'2:33',Bitcoin:'2:34',Ethereum:'2:35',CardGreen:'2:36',CardPink:'2:37',CardPurple:'2:38',FlagUSA:'2:63',FlagIndo:'2:62',Avatar:'2:65',Icon_Home:'2:2',Icon_Analytics:'2:3',Icon_Cards:'2:4',Icon_Profile:'2:5',Icon_Bell:'2:6',Icon_Message:'2:7',Icon_Back:'2:8',Icon_ArrowUpRight:'2:9',Icon_Plus:'2:10',Icon_Edit:'2:11',Icon_Delete:'2:12',Icon_Send:'2:13',Icon_Receive:'2:14',Icon_Search:'2:15',Icon_Filter:'2:16',Icon_ChevronDown:'2:17',Icon_MoreH:'2:18',Icon_MoreV:'2:19',Icon_Comment:'2:20',Icon_Like:'2:21',Icon_Dislike:'2:22',Icon_Verified:'2:23',sb:'6:110',hi:'6:122'};\n```\n- **Screen frames** (row at y=0, x=i*415): 01_Sign_Up=2005:2 (9 children), 02_OTP=2005:3 (12), 03_Home_My_Balance=2005:4 (15), 04_Home_Upcoming_Bills=2005:5 (16 incl. \"Upcoming Bills\" SectionTitle at y=172; actions/cards shifted +32), 05_Home_Transactions=2005:6 (16 incl. \"Transactions\" SectionTitle at y=172; rows shifted +34), 06_Discussion_Forum=2005:7 (12), 07_Cards=2005:8 (17), 08_Profile=2005:9 (18), 09_Analytics=2005:10 (12), 10_Markets=2005:11 (~24, count unverified — rebuilt fully), 11_Send=2005:12 (21). Backgrounds: 01/02 white; 03–11 #F6F5FA. Status bar/home indicator instances on 03–11 have `fills=[]` (transparent); 01/02 keep white\n- **Design system**: ink #151521, sec #6B6880, muted #A5A3B0, border #E9E7F2, bg #F6F5FA, card #FFFFFF, chip #EFEDF8, primary #BFB7FD, deep #7C68EE, deepSoft #EDEAFD, success #16A34A, error #F04438; shadows `SH(y,b,a)={type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.09,g:0.08,b:0.15,a},offset:{x:0,y},radius:b,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}`\n- **Standard helper code** (re-pasted per call):\n```js\nfunction hx(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nfunction S(h,o){return {type:'SOLID',color:hx(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o};}\nfunction T(p,chars,o){o=o||{};const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:F,style:o.st||'Medium'};t.fontSize=o.s||14;t.characters=chars;t.fills=[S(o.c||C.ink)];if(o.lh)t.lineHeight={value:o.lh,unit:'PIXELS'};if(o.w){t.textAutoResize='NONE';t.resize(o.w,o.h||20);}else{t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';}if(o.a)t.textAlignHorizontal=o.a;if(o.x!==undefined)t.x=o.x;if(o.y!==undefined)t.y=o.y;if(o.name)t.name=o.name;p.appendChild(t);return t;}\nfunction FR(p,o){const f=figma.createFrame();f.resize(o.w,o.h);f.x=o.x||0;f.y=o.y||0;f.fills=o.f?[S(o.f,o.o)]:[];if(o.r!==undefined)f.cornerRadius=o.r;if(o.stroke){f.strokes=[S(o.stroke)];f.strokeWeight=o.sw||1;}if(o.dash)f.dashPattern=o.dash;if(o.effects)f.effects=o.effects;f.name=o.name||'Frame';p.appendChild(f);return f;}\nfunction tintIcon(n,hex){const paint=S(hex);for(const ch of n.findAll(()=>true)){if('strokes'in ch&&ch.strokes&&ch.strokes.length>0)ch.strokes=[paint];if('fills'in ch&&ch.fills&&ch.fills.length>0&&ch.type!=='TEXT')ch.fills=[paint];}}\nconst CM={};for(const id of (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2003:2')).children.filter(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'))CM[id.name]=id;\nfunction inst(key,p,x,y,w,h){const i=COMP[key].createInstance();i.resize(w,h||w);i.x=x;i.y=y;p.appendChild(i);return i;}\nfunction cinst(name,p,x,y){const i=CM[name].createInstance();i.x=x;i.y=y;p.appendChild(i);return i;}\n```\n- **23 reusable components on workspace page** (y≈960+): Tab Bar · Active=Home/Analytics/Cards/Profile; View Switch · Active=My Balance/Upcoming Bills/Transactions; Action · Send/Receive/Add; Header Icon · Message/Bell/Back/More; Topic Chip · Selected/Default; OTP Box; Keypad Key (Digit now 111×44 CENTER/CENTER fixed in component); Contact · Add / Contact · Person; Bill Card (children: LogoBg, Logo, Name, Meta, Category, Amount, PayNow); Transaction Row (LogoBg, Logo, Name, Meta, Amount); Crypto Row (Logo, Name, Ticker, Value)\n- **Row override pattern** (used on 04/05/07/08):\n```js\nconst lg=row.findOne(n=>n.name==='Logo');lg.swapComponent(COMP[b.logo]);tintIcon(lg,b.ic);\nrow.findOne(n=>n.name==='LogoBg').fills=[S(b.bg)]; // bill/tx rows only\nrow.findOne(n=>n.name==='Name').characters=b.name; // etc.\n```\nBrand colors used: PayPal bg #D6E7FA ic #00457C; DANA #CDE9FC/#118EEA; GooglePlay #E3E7FD/#4285F4; Shopee #FDE3D6/#EE4D2D; Apple #ECECF1/#151521; Spotify #D3EDD9/#1DB954; Line #DDF2E4/#069546; AdobeXD #470137/#FF61F6; Netflix #141414/#E50914; Solana #9945FF, Bitcoin #F7931A, Ethereum #627EEA\n- **Verbatim copy extracted from 00·Start Here** (critical — used and to be verified): Legal \"By signing up, you agree to the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, including Cookie Use.\"; Devon Lane post: \"FindBuddy is a comprehensive personal finance app that allows you to track and manage your spending, create budgets, and set financial goals. It also provides a visual representation of your financial health.\"; Eleanor Pena post: \"Personal Capital is not only a budgeting tool but also an investment tracker. It provides a holistic view of your financial situation by combining budgeting and investment tracking features.\"; counts \"12 Comments · 160 Likes · 0 Dislikes\" (Devon liked = deep color); topics Personal Finance (selected)/Investments/Cryptocurrencies; search \"Search...\"; bills: Line Messenger $21.00 due Sep 05, 2023 · 1 month / Adobe XD $126.02 · Sep 19, 2023 · 1 month / Netflix $932.53 · Jul 08, 2024 · 1 year (all Subscriptions, Pay now); transactions: PayPal Transferred -$123.00 Aug 19, 2023; DANA Transferred -$12.00 Jul 20, 2023; Google Play Refund +$234.00 May 08, 2023; Shopee Refund +$15.00 Feb 28, 2023; Apple Payment -$92.00 Jan 25, 2023; Spotify Payment -$20.00 Jan 16, 2023; balance $190,008.03 +8% USD; Mon 24K Tue 35K Wed 45K Thu 22K Fri 34K Sat 18K Sun 30K (10K–50K axis); contacts Bessie Cooper, Devon Lane, Eleanor Pena, Jenny Wilson, Cody Fisher; cards: Green 3447 Exp 09/24 primary, Pink 8821 Exp 03/26, Purple 5104 Exp 11/25 (all Esaaa Warden); assets Solana SOL $12,094.08 / Bitcoin BTC $17,238.11 / Ethereum ETH $8,200.00; analytics Total income $29,231.03, Total expenses $1,999.00, Sales $15,190.00 52%, Investment $11,451.03 39%, Other $2,590.00 9%, headline 52% (Sales), Monthly, Income selected; markets: Current price $1,954.00 (+3.85%), ranges 1H 2H 8H 1D(active) 1W 1M 1Y, y $1,000–$5,000, x 08:00 10:00 12:00 15:00 18:00 21:00 24:00; send: Bessie Cooper **** **** **** 8820, $500.00, keypad 1–9 \".\" 0 backspace, button \"Send\"\n- **Bar chart on 03**: baseline y=118, h=(v−10)/40×66, bars 22px wide at x=40+i*40, Wed highlighted deep, day labels repositioned at y=130 after fix\n- **Donut on 09**: 3 ellipses 160×160 at (87.5,24) in 335×272 card, innerRadius 0.62, arcData from st0=−π/2: Sales deep 0.52·2π, Investment primary 0.39·2π, Other #E4E0FA remainder; center \"52%\" SemiBold 24 / \"Sales\" muted\n- **Candles on 10**: card 335×200 @(20,306), plot x 44–327 y 14–160, yv=v=>160−(v−1000)*0.0365, 14 candles (o,c,lo,hi): (1200,1600,1100,1700),(1600,1500,1400,1750),(1500,2100,1450,2200),(2100,1900,1800,2250),(1900,2500,1850,2600),(2500,2300,2200,2650),(2300,2900,2250,3000),(2900,2700,2600,3050),(2700,3300,2600,3400),(3300,3100,3000,3450),(3100,3700,3050,3800),(3700,3500,3400,3900),(3500,4100,3450,4200),(4100,3900,3800,4300); up #16A34A / down #F04438; wick 1.5px, body 11px r2; Sell/Buy at y=718 h50 (Buy = Button instance renamed)\n- **Keypad on 11**: Keypad Key instances at x=20+col*112, y=352+row*58; digits set via `key.findOne(n=>n.name==='Digit').characters=k` only; backspace = plain FR 111×44 with Icon_Delete tinted ink at (45.5,12)\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n- **lineHeight validation**: fixed earlier with `{value:px,unit:'PIXELS'}`\n- **Figma MCP rate limit** (3× total): \"You've reached the Figma MCP tool call limit for your Full seat on the Enterprise plan\" — fixed by retrying the same call after a brief wait (succeeded each time). Last wiring attempt hit it; needs retry\n- **Sloppy inline measurement strays on 03**: `T(chip1,'+8%',{...}).x=(52-T(bc,'+8%',...).width)/2` and day-label loop each created a duplicate stray text node. Fixed by removing the stray '+8%' from Balance Card and all 14 day texts then recreating 7 at y=130 with proper x centering\n- **Missing section titles**: 04/05 briefs require \"Upcoming Bills\"/\"Transactions\" headings — added at y=172 with element shifts (+32 bills/actions on 04, +34 tx rows on 05)\n- **`y=566` typo** (object literal used `y=` instead of `y:`) → SyntaxError \"expecting '}'\" → fixed and resent\n- **\"Cannot move node. New parent is an instance\"**: tried `T(card,...)` appending overlay text into Card_Art_Green INSTANCE → fixed by wrapping art in plain frame `cardW` (FR) and appending texts to the frame; rebuilt 07 from clean (`for(const c of [...f.children])c.remove()`)\n- **`f2 is not defined`** (stray `const al=f2=null;` line) → ReferenceError mid-call after 10 was fully built; cleaned both frames and rebuilt 10+11\n- **\"Cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform\"**: `d.x=(111-d.width)/2` on Digit text inside Keypad Key instance → fixed by editing the COMPONENT: `dig.textAutoResize='NONE';dig.resize(111,44);dig.x=0;dig.y=0;dig.textAlignHorizontal='CENTER';dig.textAlignVertical='CENTER'`; instances only set characters; backspace key as plain frame (can't append icon into instance)\n- **reactions validation error**: `{type:'NODE',destinationId,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{type:'INSTANT'}}` rejected — INSTANT not a valid transition type → fix (NOT YET EXECUTED): omit transition entirely: `{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},action:{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE'}}`\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n- Re-read 00·Start Here via read-only use_figma text extraction (two slices: 0–6000, 6000–13000 chars) to get all verbatim copy before building 06 — this corrected the plan (04/05 need section titles; exact