{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\nComplete a Figma product design benchmark (unattended session). Requirements:\n- Assigned file ONLY: https://www.figma.com/design/LzOLhHIkMxbZRdyAhxIn1B/ (fileKey `LzOLhHIkMxbZRdyAhxIn1B`); account must be zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai (confirmed via whoami earlier in session)\n- Read 「00·Start Here」 for product/screens/states/data/copy/prototype requirements; follow 「01·Foundations」 visual spec; reuse 「02·Components」; use 「04·Media」 assets; deliver complete design into 「03·Workspace」 (page 2003:2)\n- Preserve all reference pages and their nodes; do not create a different Figma file or switch accounts; keep existing unrelated content intact; starter read-only instructions apply to reference pages, not the workspace\n- Build exactly 11 named frames (375×812, light mode, Plus Jakarta Sans, primary #BFB7FD), wire as clickable prototype with specified links, match all fixed copy/data verbatim, create reusable components, verify via screenshots of ALL screens, fix visible problems, finish all screens/states/flows before final answer\n- Prototype brief: main nav tabs Home→2005:4, Analytics→2005:10, Cards→2005:8, Profile→2005:9 on frames 03/04/05/07/08/09 with current tab matching; pushed screens with back: 02, 06, 07, 08, 09, 10, 11; 06/10/11 have NO main nav; specific links: 01 Continue→02; 02 back→01, Continue→03; 03 Upcoming Bills→04, Transactions→05, Send→11, contact Bessie Cooper→11, Financial health details→09, messages→06; 04 My Balance→03, Transactions→05; 05 My Balance→03, Upcoming Bills→04; 06 back→03; 07 back→03, Bitcoin→10; 08 See all→05; 09 back→03; 10 back→07; 11 back→03, Send→03\n- Process: whoami → get_metadata → read-only use_figma inspect → use_figma build → get_screenshot verify; load fonts before text; build in manageable sections; add prototype interactions after screens exist; inspect screenshots of all required screens; finish with assigned file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations\n- Formatting: every tool-call message must start with a line prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; after each tool result do the same before next call; final response starts `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:`\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n- **WORKING reactions format (critical)**: `node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null}]}]` — MUST use `actions` (array) not `action` (runtime deprecation error), and `transition:null` is REQUIRED (omitting transition fails Zod schema; `{type:'INSTANT'}` rejected)\n- **Self-navigation rejected**: \"for NAVIGATE actions, destinations must be a different top-level frame on the same page\" → hit overlays must skip links where destination equals the frame's own ID (active tab/switch on its own screen gets no link)\n- Hit overlays: transparent frames (opacity 0.001, fill #151521) named 'Hit · Tab Home' etc., since reactions can't be set on nodes inside instances; tab bar 4×93.75×64 at y=714; view switch 3×109×32 at x=24+i*109, y=120\n- Figma Plugin API via use_figma: clone(), swapComponent(), tintIcon, textAutoResize 'HEIGHT' for wrapped text growth, dashPattern, arcData, flowStartingPoints\n- `node.componentId` does NOT exist on InstanceNode in this runtime\n- findOne by name can match TEXT nodes — must guard with type checks\n- Font loading: `await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Regular'|'Medium'|'SemiBold'})` before any text ops\n- Rate limit: \"You've reached the Figma MCP tool call limit for your Full seat on the Enterprise plan\" occurs frequently (~1 in 3 calls); retrying the same call after a brief wait succeeds — happened 8+ times total\n- lineHeight must be `{value:px,unit:'PIXELS'}`\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n- **Figma pages**: 0:1 (00·Start Here, read-only ref), 1:2 (01·Foundations), 1:3 (02·Components), 1:4 (04·Media), 2003:2 (03·Workspace — delivery target)\n- **Media component ID map**:\n```js\nconst IM={btn:'3:52',Line:'2:26',Netflix:'2:25',AdobeXD:'2:24',PayPal:'2:27',DANA:'2:28',GooglePlay:'2:29',Shopee:'2:30',Apple:'2:31',Spotify:'2:32',Solana:'2:33',Bitcoin:'2:34',Ethereum:'2:35',CardGreen:'2:36',CardPink:'2:37',CardPurple:'2:38',FlagUSA:'2:63',FlagIndo:'2:62',Avatar:'2:65',Icon_Home:'2:2',Icon_Analytics:'2:3',Icon_Cards:'2:4',Icon_Profile:'2:5',Icon_Bell:'2:6',Icon_Message:'2:7',Icon_Back:'2:8',Icon_ArrowUpRight:'2:9',Icon_Plus:'2:10',Icon_Edit:'2:11',Icon_Delete:'2:12',Icon_Send:'2:13',Icon_Receive:'2:14',Icon_Search:'2:15',Icon_Filter:'2:16',Icon_ChevronDown:'2:17',Icon_MoreH:'2:18',Icon_MoreV:'2:19',Icon_Comment:'2:20',Icon_Like:'2:21',Icon_Dislike:'2:22',Icon_Verified:'2:23',sb:'6:110',hi:'6:122'};\n```\n- **Screen frames** (row at y=0): 01_Sign_Up=2005:2, 02_OTP=2005:3, 03_Home_My_Balance=2005:4, 04_Home_Upcoming_Bills=2005:5, 05_Home_Transactions=2005:6, 06_Discussion_Forum=2005:7, 07_Cards=2005:8, 08_Profile=2005:9, 09_Analytics=2005:10, 10_Markets=2005:11 (REBUILT this segment, 23 children), 11_Send=2005:12. Backgrounds: 01/02 white; 03–11 #F6F5FA\n- **Standard helper code** (re-pasted per call):\n```js\nfunction hx(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nfunction S(h,o){return {type:'SOLID',color:hx(h),opacity:o===undefined?1:o};}\nfunction T(p,chars,o){o=o||{};const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:F,style:o.st||'Medium'};t.fontSize=o.s||14;t.characters=chars;t.fills=[S(o.c||C.ink)];if(o.lh)t.lineHeight={value:o.lh,unit:'PIXELS'};if(o.w){t.textAutoResize='NONE';t.resize(o.w,o.h||20);}else{t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';}if(o.a)t.textAlignHorizontal=o.a;if(o.x!==undefined)t.x=o.x;if(o.y!==undefined)t.y=o.y;p.appendChild(t);return t;}\nfunction FR(p,o){const f=figma.createFrame();f.resize(o.w,o.h);f.x=o.x||0;f.y=o.y||0;f.fills=o.f?[S(o.f,o.o)]:[];if(o.r!==undefined)f.cornerRadius=o.r;if(o.stroke){f.strokes=[S(o.stroke)];f.strokeWeight=o.sw||1;}if(o.dash)f.dashPattern=o.dash;if(o.effects)f.effects=o.effects;f.name=o.name||'Frame';p.appendChild(f);return f;}\nfunction tintIcon(n,hex){const paint=S(hex);for(const ch of n.findAll(()=>true)){if('strokes'in ch&&ch.strokes&&ch.strokes.length>0)ch.strokes=[paint];if('fills'in ch&&ch.fills&&ch.fills.length>0&&ch.type!=='TEXT')ch.fills=[paint];}}\nconst CM={};for(const id of (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2003:2')).children.filter(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'))CM[id.name]=id;\nfunction link(node,dest){node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:[{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:null}]}];}\n```\n- **Design tokens**: ink #151521, sec #6B6880, muted #A5A3B0, border #E9E7F2, bg #F6F5FA, card #FFFFFF, primary #BFB7FD, deep #7C68EE, deepSoft #EDEAFD, success #16A34A, error #F04438; brand colors: PayPal bg #D6E7FA ic #00457C; DANA #CDE9FC/#118EEA; GooglePlay #E3E7FD/#4285F4; Shopee #FDE3D6/#EE4D2D; Apple #ECECF1/#151521; Spotify #D3EDD9/#1DB954; Line #DDF2E4/#069546; AdobeXD #470137/#FF61F6; Netflix #141414/#E50914; Solana #9945FF, Bitcoin #F7931A, Ethereum #627EEA\n- **23 reusable components on workspace page**: Tab Bar ×4 (Active=Home/Analytics/Cards/Profile), View Switch ×3 (My Balance/Upcoming Bills/Transactions), Action ×3 (Send/Receive/Add), Header Icon ×4 (Message/Bell/Back/More), Topic Chip ×2, OTP Box, Keypad Key, Contact ×2 (Add/Person), Bill Card, Transaction Row, Crypto Row\n- **Transaction Row structure** (confirmed): 335×56; LogoBg 40×40 RECTANGLE @(0,8); Logo 24×24 INSTANCE @(8,16); Name@52,7; Meta@52,30; Amount@250,19\n- **10_Markets rebuild** (23 children): header cloned from f7 (Status Bar, Back, Avatar, More, Home Indicator with fills=[], title 'Markets'); 'Current price' 13px sec @24,104; '$1,954.00' SemiBold 32 @24,126; '+3.85%' chip 66×24 r12 #E7F6EC w/ success text; 7 range chips 38×28 @y=206 x=24+i*44.17 (1D active deep/white, others white+border); Chart Card 335×240 @(20,256) r20; Plot with yv=v=>190-(v-1000)*0.0435, dashed gridlines [3,4] #E9E7F2 at $1,000–$5,000, 14 candles cd=[[1200,1600,1100,1700],[1600,1500,1400,1750],[1500,2100,1450,2200],[2100,1900,1800,2250],[1900,2500,1850,2600],[2500,2300,2200,2650],[2300,2900,2250,3000],[2900,2700,2600,3050],[2700,3300,2600,3400],[3300,3100,3000,3450],[3100,3700,3050,3800],[3700,3500,3400,3900],[3500,4100,3450,4200],[4100,3900,3800,4300]] (up #16A34A/down #F04438, wick 1.5px cx=44+(i+0.5)*19.643, body 11px r2), x labels 08:00–24:00 @y=200; 'Assets' SemiBold 16 @24,518; 3 Crypto Row instances @x=20 y=548/602/656 (Solana SOL $12,094.08 / Bitcoin BTC $17,238.11 / Ethereum ETH $8,200.00, logos swapped to 2:33/2:34/2:35 tinted brand colors); BuyButton=clone of f11 SendButton 157.5×50 @(193.5,718) text 'Buy'; SellButton=FR 157.5×50 @(24,718) r25 white+border text 'Sell'\n- **05 tx rows confirmed** (all correct): 'Tx PayPal'@20,210, 'Tx DANA'@278, 'Tx Google Play'@346, 'Tx Shopee'@414, 'Tx Apple'@482, 'Tx Spotify'@550 — each 335×56, LogoBg fills correctly pale brand colors, amounts correct (−$123.00, −$12.00, +$234.00 green, +$15.00 green, −$92.00, −$20.00)\n- **03 f3 layout**: Status Bar@0,0; Avatar@20,52 48×48; Hi, Esaaa!@80,54; Aug 20, 2023@80,78; Messages@263,56; Notifications@311,56; ViewSwitch@20,116 335×40; Balance Card@20,172 335×148; ActionSend/Receive/Add@20/150/279,340 76×76; Financial Health@20,436 335×148; Transfer List@20,600→(fixed)590 335×108→118 clip=true; Tab Bar@0,714; Home Indicator@0,778\n- **06 f6 layout (after fix)**: Back@24,60; 'Discussion Forum' title x=79 (was 103, overlapped icons@263); Messages@263,60; Notifications@311,60;